Package: fireData
Title: Connect R to 'Google Firebase'
Version: 2.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Robin", "Gounder", email = "robin@gounder.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-7755-7081")),
    person("Paul", "Spende", role = "aut"),
    person("Kevin", "McGinley", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Provides an R interface to 'Google Firebase' services, including
    Realtime Database, Cloud Firestore, Authentication, and Cloud Storage.
    Supports interactive use in R and 'Shiny' applications as well as automated
    server-side workflows. Data frames and R objects can be stored and retrieved,
    users can be authenticated, and files can be managed through service APIs.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
